{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的快速扫读不如X醒目，缺少关键词加亮和感受随乐句出现的时间提示。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的关键词高亮和话、感受交替出现，确实更容易快速定位，也更容易跟随音乐捕捉瞬间变化。但Y的人物叙事更完整，尤其S06、S11、S13，人物为什么孤单、为什么愿意继续付出、为什么既想藏回喜欢又藏不回去，都交代得更准确；X有几处改写改变了人物动机，甚至削弱了关键矛盾。Y的感受词也更贴近具体的人际体验，呼吸、体温、鼻尖发酸、甜中带刺等细节比X部分偏抽象的音乐意象更容易让普通观众真正感受到人物。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a22caf00-0f50-46eb-953d-a0da7885796d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T193624165367Z", "elapsed_seconds": 142.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:38:46.746549+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ef703f8e0a9e89b1f97a032058dbfdff8bc0e15b5f7e7647c457b8052324d8d2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g